    <string name="sms_refusal_not_default">Your messages were NOT restored.\n\n白い熊 メッセージ is not the default SMS app, and Android only lets the default SMS app write to the message store.\n\nWhat to do: Settings → Apps → Default apps → SMS app → 白い熊 メッセージ. Then run the restore again.\n\nNothing has been lost — the messages are still in the backup.</string>
    <string name="sms_refusal_blocked">Your messages were NOT restored.\n\n白い熊 メッセージ is already shown as the SMS app, but Android is still refusing every write: the setting was recorded without the permission that goes with it, so it does not yet mean anything.\n\nWhat to do: Settings → Apps → Default apps → SMS app. Pick a DIFFERENT app, then pick 白い熊 メッセージ again — re-applying it is what grants the permission. Then run the restore again.\n\nNothing has been lost — the messages are still in the backup.</string>
    <string name="sms_refusal_unknown">Your messages were NOT restored.\n\nAndroid accepted none of the first %1$d messages, even though 白い熊 メッセージ is the SMS app and message writing is permitted.\n\nWhat to do: restart the phone and run the restore again. If it happens a second time, this needs looking at.\n\nNothing has been lost — the messages are still in the backup.</string>
